#import "/_lib/0.1.1.typ": *
#show: template

#taxon[Definition]
#title[Groupoid Cardinality]

Let $X$ be a 1-type that is both $pi_0$ finite and $pi_1$ finite. Define the
_groupoid cardinality_ of $X$ as the rational number
$
  |X|_"groupoid" :-= plus.big_(|x|_0 : ||X||_0) 1/(|"Aut"_X (x)||,
$
Note that the automorphism cardinality is well defined by
#local("00EQ")[Lemma 00EQ]. Also note that we are treating the automorphism
cardinality (a natural number) as a rational number in the fraction.
